Package: gh0st
Version: @GH0ST_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Gh0st OS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Depends: gh0st-panel-modules, xdg-user-dirs, network-manager, wireplumber,
 bluez, rfkill, pkexec, polkitd, libpam-modules-bin, raspi-utils-core, passwd, apt,
 iw, dnsmasq-base, nftables
Description: Gh0stdeck, the CardputerZero shell and Settings
 The home screen, switcher and OS bars (gh0st shell), Settings
 (gh0st-settings), Updates (gh0st-update and the update engine) and the
 root helper. Static binaries; the Depends are the
 commands they run: nmcli, wpctl, bluetoothctl, rfkill, pkexec, vcgencmd,
 unix_chkpwd, passwd, iw, and systemd's systemctl, timedatectl and
 hostnamectl. dnsmasq-base and nftables are what NetworkManager's shared
 mode runs for the hotspot: DHCP and DNS, and NAT.
